:"s-shiji-101-yuanchao"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:p018","text":"景帝即位，以錯為內史。錯常數請閒言事，輒聽，寵幸傾九卿，法令多所更定。丞相申屠嘉心弗便，力未有以傷。內史府居太上廟壖中，門東出，不便，錯乃穿兩門南出，鑿廟壖垣。丞相嘉聞，大怒，欲因此過為奏請誅錯。錯聞之，即夜請閒，具為上言之。丞相奏事，因言錯擅鑿廟垣為門，請下廷尉誅。上曰：「此非廟垣，乃壖中垣，不致於法。」丞相謝。罷朝，怒謂長史曰：「吾當先斬以聞，乃先請，為兒所賣，固誤。」丞相遂發病死。錯以此愈貴。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"etc_iw9_5so","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"申屠嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"olo_0sp_7bd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0080","start":80,"end":83,"surface":"丞相嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"olo_0sp_7bd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0120","start":120,"end":121,"surface":"錯","kind":"person","person_id":"04u_gq0_nke_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"etc_iw9_5so","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-101-yuanchao:m018-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"長史","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status"